%% CTU-Service RAG Pipeline Flowchart
%% Complete RAG query flow with tech stack details

flowchart TD
    Start([User Query]) --> Validate[Input Validation]
    Validate --> Normalize[Query Normalization]
    Normalize --> Filter[Metadata Filter]
    Filter --> Dense[Dense Retrieval<br/>Qdrant]
    Filter --> Sparse[Sparse Retrieval<br/>PostgreSQL FTS]
    Dense --> Fusion[RRF Fusion]
    Sparse --> Fusion
    Fusion --> Rerank[Reranking]
    Rerank --> Expand[Parent Context Expansion]
    Expand --> Prompt[Build Prompt]
    Prompt --> LLM[LLM Generation]
    LLM --> Citation[Citation Validation]
    Citation --> Response([Answer + Citations])

